{"1-8":{"people":[{"id":"levi-h3878","name":"Levi","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":4,"firstVerse":1},{"id":"israel-h3478","name":"Israel","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Isaac","count":3,"firstVerse":1},{"id":"eleazar-h0499g","name":"Eleazar","kind":"person","brief":"A High Priest","count":1,"firstVerse":1},{"id":"joshua-h3091g","name":"Joshua","kind":"person","brief":"A judge","count":1,"firstVerse":1},{"id":"nun-h5126","name":"Nun","kind":"person","brief":"Father of Joshua","count":1,"firstVerse":1},{"id":"moses-h4872","name":"Moses","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Amram","count":2,"firstVerse":2},{"id":"kohath-h6955","name":"Kohath","kind":"person","brief":"Levi's son","count":2,"firstVerse":4},{"id":"aaron-h0175","name":"Aaron","kind":"person","brief":"High Priest","count":1,"firstVerse":4},{"id":"benjamin-h1144g","name":"Benjamin","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":1,"firstVerse":4},{"id":"judah-h3063g","name":"Judah","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":1,"firstVerse":4},{"id":"simeon-h8095g","name":"Simeon","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":1,"firstVerse":4},{"id":"manasseh-h4519g","name":"Manasseh","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Joseph","count":2,"firstVerse":5},{"id":"ephraim-h0669g","name":"Ephraim","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Joseph","count":1,"firstVerse":5},{"id":"asher-h0836","name":"Asher","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":1,"firstVerse":6},{"id":"gershon-h1648","name":"Gershon","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Levi","count":1,"firstVerse":6},{"id":"issachar-h3485g","name":"Issachar","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":1,"firstVerse":6},{"id":"naphtali-h5321g","name":"Naphtali","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":1,"firstVerse":6},{"id":"gad-h1410g","name":"Gad","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":1,"firstVerse":7},{"id":"merari-h4847","name":"Merari","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Levi","count":1,"firstVerse":7},{"id":"reuben-h7205","name":"Reuben","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":1,"firstVerse":7},{"id":"zebulun-h2074","name":"Zebulun","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":1,"firstVerse":7}],"places":[{"id":"canaan-h3667a","name":"Canaan","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":2},{"id":"shiloh-h7887","name":"Shiloh","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":2},{"id":"dan-h1835g","name":"Dan","kind":"place","brief":"In Dan","count":1,"firstVerse":5},{"id":"bashan-h1316","name":"Bashan","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":6}],"words":[{"base":"H4294","lemma":"מַטֶּה","tr":"mat·teh","gloss":"tribe: rod","lang":"h","inPassage":14,"uses":252},{"base":"H1486","lemma":"גּוֹרָל","tr":"go·ral","gloss":"allotted","lang":"h","inPassage":5,"uses":77},{"base":"H5892","lemma":"עִיר","tr":"ir","gloss":"excitement","lang":"h","inPassage":7,"uses":1090},{"base":"H3881","lemma":"לֵוִי","tr":"le·viy·yi","gloss":"Levi","lang":"h","inPassage":4,"uses":291},{"base":"H4940","lemma":"מִשְׁפָּחָה","tr":"mish·pa·chah","gloss":"family","lang":"h","inPassage":4,"uses":303},{"base":"H4054","lemma":"מִגְרָשׁ","tr":"mig·rash","gloss":"pasture","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":115},{"base":"H6240","lemma":"עָשָׂר","tr":"a·sar","gloss":"ten","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":337},{"base":"H2677","lemma":"חֲצִי","tr":"che·tsi","gloss":"half","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":125},{"base":"H4519","lemma":"מְנַשֶּׁה","tr":"me·nash·sheh","gloss":"Manasseh","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":146},{"base":"H7969","lemma":"שָׁלֹשׁ","tr":"sha·losh","gloss":"three","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":431}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"GEN","chapter":46,"verse":11,"verseEnd":11,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"The sons of Levi: Gershon, Kohath, and Merari.","from":5},{"book":"GEN","chapter":49,"verse":7,"verseEnd":7,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Cursed be their anger, for it is strong, and their wrath, for it is cruel! I will disperse them in Jacob and scatter them in Israel.","from":3},{"book":"EXO","chapter":6,"verse":14,"verseEnd":14,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"These were the heads of their fathersʼ houses: The sons of Reuben, the firstborn of Israel, were Hanoch and Pallu, Hezron and Carmi. These were the clans of Reuben.","from":1},{"book":"EXO","chapter":6,"verse":16,"verseEnd":25,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"These were the names of the sons of Levi according to their records: Gershon, Kohath, and Merari. Levi lived 137 years. The sons of Gershon were Libni and Shimei, by their clans. The sons of Kohath were Amram, Izhar, Hebron, and Uzziel. Kohath lived 133 years. The sons of Merari were Mahli and Mushi. These were the clans of the Levites according to their records. And Amram married his fatherʼs sister Jochebed, and she bore him Aaron and Moses. Amram lived 137 years.","from":5},{"book":"EXO","chapter":6,"verse":16,"verseEnd":17,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"These were the names of the sons of Levi according to their records: Gershon, Kohath, and Merari. Levi lived 137 years. The sons of Gershon were Libni and Shimei, by their clans.","from":6},{"book":"EXO","chapter":6,"verse":19,"verseEnd":19,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"The sons of Merari were Mahli and Mushi. These were the clans of the Levites according to their records.","from":7},{"book":"EXO","chapter":6,"verse":25,"verseEnd":25,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Aaronʼs son Eleazar married one of the daughters of Putiel, and she bore him Phinehas. These were the heads of the Levite families by their clans.","from":1},{"book":"NUM","chapter":3,"verse":20,"verseEnd":20,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"And the sons of Merari by their clans were Mahli and Mushi. These were the clans of the Levites, according to their families.","from":7}],"notes":[{"id":"gen-49-simeon-levi","title":"Simeon and Levi scattered in Israel","kind":"prophecy"}],"groups":[{"id":"patriarchs","title":"The patriarchal families","people":11},{"id":"exodus-family","title":"Moses and his circle","people":6}]},"9-19":{"people":[{"id":"judah-h3063g","name":"Judah","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":2,"firstVerse":9},{"id":"simeon-h8095g","name":"Simeon","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":1,"firstVerse":9},{"id":"aaron-h0175","name":"Aaron","kind":"person","brief":"High Priest","count":3,"firstVerse":10},{"id":"kohath-h6955","name":"Kohath","kind":"person","brief":"Levi's son","count":1,"firstVerse":10},{"id":"levi-h3878","name":"Levi","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":1,"firstVerse":10},{"id":"anak-h6061","name":"Anak","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Arba","count":1,"firstVerse":11},{"id":"arba-h0704","name":"Arba","kind":"person","brief":"Father of Anak","count":1,"firstVerse":11},{"id":"caleb-h3612g","name":"Caleb","kind":"person","brief":"Joshua's compatriot","count":1,"firstVerse":12},{"id":"jephunneh-h3312g","name":"Jephunneh","kind":"person","brief":"Caleb's father","count":1,"firstVerse":12},{"id":"benjamin-h1144g","name":"Benjamin","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":1,"firstVerse":17}],"places":[{"id":"hebron-h2275a","name":"Hebron","kind":"place","brief":"","count":2,"firstVerse":11},{"id":"libnah-h3841h","name":"Libnah","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":13},{"id":"eshtemoa-h0851","name":"Eshtemoa","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":14},{"id":"jattir-h3492","name":"Jattir","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":14},{"id":"debir-h1688a","name":"Debir","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":15},{"id":"holon-h2473g","name":"Holon","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":15},{"id":"ain-h5871h","name":"Ain","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":16},{"id":"beth-shemesh-h1053g","name":"Beth-shemesh","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":16},{"id":"juttah-h3194","name":"Juttah","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":16},{"id":"geba-h1387g","name":"Geba","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":17},{"id":"gibeon-h1391","name":"Gibeon","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":17},{"id":"alemeth-h5964g","name":"Alemeth","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":18},{"id":"anathoth-h6068g","name":"Anathoth","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":18}],"words":[{"base":"H4054","lemma":"מִגְרָשׁ","tr":"mig·rash","gloss":"pasture","lang":"h","inPassage":15,"uses":115},{"base":"H5892","lemma":"עִיר","tr":"ir","gloss":"excitement","lang":"h","inPassage":7,"uses":1090},{"base":"H4294","lemma":"מַטֶּה","tr":"mat·teh","gloss":"tribe: rod","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":252},{"base":"H7153","lemma":"קִרְיַת אַרְבַּע","tr":"qir·yat ar·ba","gloss":"Kiriath-arba","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":18},{"base":"H0175","lemma":"אַהֲרֹן","tr":"a·ha·ron","gloss":"Aaron","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":347},{"base":"H1053","lemma":"בֵּית שֶׁ֫מֶשׁ","tr":"bet she·mesh","gloss":"Beth-shemesh","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":42},{"base":"H2275","lemma":"חֶבְרוֹן","tr":"chev·ron","gloss":"Hebron","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":71},{"base":"H3194","lemma":"יֻטָּה","tr":"yut·tah","gloss":"Juttah","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":2},{"base":"H2473","lemma":"חֹלוֹן","tr":"cho·lon","gloss":"Holon","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":3},{"base":"H3492","lemma":"יַתִּיר","tr":"yat·tir","gloss":"Jattir","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":4}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"1CH","chapter":6,"verse":55,"verseEnd":55,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"They were given Hebron in the land of Judah and its surrounding pasturelands.","from":11},{"book":"GEN","chapter":23,"verse":2,"verseEnd":2,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"She died in Kiriath-arba (that is, Hebron) in the land of Canaan, and Abraham went out to mourn and to weep for her.","from":11},{"book":"GEN","chapter":35,"verse":27,"verseEnd":27,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Jacob returned to his father Isaac at Mamre, near Kiriath-arba (that is, Hebron), where Abraham and Isaac had stayed.","from":11},{"book":"EXO","chapter":6,"verse":18,"verseEnd":18,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"The sons of Kohath were Amram, Izhar, Hebron, and Uzziel. Kohath lived 133 years.","from":10},{"book":"EXO","chapter":6,"verse":20,"verseEnd":26,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"And Amram married his fatherʼs sister Jochebed, and she bore him Aaron and Moses. Amram lived 137 years. The sons of Izhar were Korah, Nepheg, and Zichri. The sons of Uzziel were Mishael, Elzaphan, and Sithri. And Aaron married Elisheba, the daughter of Amminadab and sister of Nahshon, and she bore him Nadab and Abihu, Eleazar and Ithamar. The sons of Korah were Assir, Elkanah, and Abiasaph. These were the clans of the Korahites.","from":10},{"book":"NUM","chapter":3,"verse":2,"verseEnd":4,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"These are the names of the sons of Aaron: Nadab the firstborn, then Abihu, Eleazar, and Ithamar. These were Aaronʼs sons, the anointed priests, who were ordained to serve as priests. Nadab and Abihu, however, died in the presence of the LORD when they offered unauthorized fire before the LORD in the Wilderness of Sinai. And since they had no sons, only Eleazar and Ithamar served as priests during the lifetime of their father Aaron.","from":10},{"book":"NUM","chapter":3,"verse":19,"verseEnd":19,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"The sons of Kohath by their clans were Amram, Izhar, Hebron, and Uzziel.","from":10},{"book":"NUM","chapter":3,"verse":27,"verseEnd":27,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"From Kohath came the clans of the Amramites, the Izharites, the Hebronites, and the Uzzielites; these were the clans of the Kohathites.","from":10}],"notes":[],"groups":[{"id":"patriarchs","title":"The patriarchal families","people":4},{"id":"exodus-family","title":"Moses and his circle","people":3}]},"20-26":{"people":[{"id":"ephraim-h0669g","name":"Ephraim","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Joseph","count":2,"firstVerse":20},{"id":"kohath-h6955","name":"Kohath","kind":"person","brief":"Levi's son","count":2,"firstVerse":20},{"id":"levi-h3878"