uses":106},{"base":"H0669","lemma":"אֶפְרַ֫יִם","tr":"eph·ra·yim","gloss":"Ephraim","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":180},{"base":"H4940","lemma":"מִשְׁפָּחָה","tr":"mish·pa·chah","gloss":"family","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":303},{"base":"H0702","lemma":"אַרְבַּע","tr":"ar·ba","gloss":"four","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":318}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"JOS","chapter":20,"verse":7,"verseEnd":7,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"So they set apart Kedesh in Galilee in the hill country of Naphtali, Shechem in the hill country of Ephraim, and Kiriath-arba (that is, Hebron) in the hill country of Judah.","from":21},{"book":"GEN","chapter":33,"verse":19,"verseEnd":19,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"And the plot of ground where he pitched his tent, he purchased from the sons of Hamor, Shechemʼs father, for a hundred pieces of silver.","from":21},{"book":"JOS","chapter":10,"verse":12,"verseEnd":12,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"On the day that the LORD gave the Amorites over to the Israelites, Joshua spoke to the LORD in the presence of Israel: “O sun, stand still over Gibeon, O moon, over the Valley of Aijalon.”","from":24},{"book":"JOS","chapter":16,"verse":3,"verseEnd":3,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Then it descended westward to the border of the Japhletites as far as the border of Lower Beth-horon and on to Gezer, and it ended at the Sea.","from":22},{"book":"JOS","chapter":16,"verse":5,"verseEnd":5,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"This was the territory of the descendants of Ephraim by their clans: The border of their inheritance went from Ataroth-addar in the east to Upper Beth-horon","from":22},{"book":"JOS","chapter":16,"verse":10,"verseEnd":10,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"But they did not drive out the Canaanites who lived in Gezer. So the Canaanites dwell among the Ephraimites to this day, but they are forced laborers.","from":21},{"book":"JOS","chapter":17,"verse":11,"verseEnd":11,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Within Issachar and Asher, Manasseh was assigned Beth-shean, Ibleam, Dor (that is, Naphath), Endor, Taanach, and Megiddo, each with their surrounding settlements.","from":25},{"book":"JOS","chapter":18,"verse":13,"verseEnd":14,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"From there the border crossed over to the southern slope of Luz (that is, Bethel) and went down to Ataroth-addar on the hill south of Lower Beth-horon. On the west side the border curved southward from the hill facing Beth-horon on the south and came out at Kiriath-baal (that is, Kiriath-jearim), a city of the sons of Judah. This was the western side.","from":22}],"notes":[],"groups":[]},"27-33":{"people":[{"id":"gershon-h1648","name":"Gershon","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Levi","count":2,"firstVerse":27},{"id":"levi-h3878","name":"Levi","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":1,"firstVerse":27},{"id":"manasseh-h4519g","name":"Manasseh","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Joseph","count":1,"firstVerse":27},{"id":"issachar-h3485g","name":"Issachar","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":1,"firstVerse":28},{"id":"asher-h0836","name":"Asher","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":1,"firstVerse":30},{"id":"naphtali-h5321g","name":"Naphtali","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":1,"firstVerse":32}],"places":[{"id":"ashtaroth-h6252h","name":"Ashtaroth","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":27},{"id":"bashan-h1316","name":"Bashan","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":27},{"id":"golan-h1474","name":"Golan","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":27},{"id":"daberath-h1705","name":"Daberath","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":28},{"id":"kishion-h7191","name":"Kishion","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":28},{"id":"en-gannim-h5873h","name":"En-gannim","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":29},{"id":"jarmuth-h3412h","name":"Jarmuth","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":29},{"id":"abdon-h5658g","name":"Abdon","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":30},{"id":"mishal-h4861","name":"Mishal","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":30},{"id":"helkath-h2520","name":"Helkath","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":31},{"id":"rehob-h7340h","name":"Rehob","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":31},{"id":"galilee-h1551","name":"Galilee","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":32},{"id":"hammath-h2575a","name":"Hammath","kind":"place","brief":"In Judah","count":1,"firstVerse":32},{"id":"kartan-h7178","name":"Kartan","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":32},{"id":"kedesh-h6943g","name":"Kedesh","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":32}],"words":[{"base":"H4054","lemma":"מִגְרָשׁ","tr":"mig·rash","gloss":"pasture","lang":"h","inPassage":14,"uses":115},{"base":"H5892","lemma":"עִיר","tr":"ir","gloss":"excitement","lang":"h","inPassage":8,"uses":1090},{"base":"H4294","lemma":"מַטֶּה","tr":"mat·teh","gloss":"tribe: rod","lang":"h","inPassage":4,"uses":252},{"base":"H2576","lemma":"חַמֹּת דֹּאר","tr":"cham·mot dor","gloss":"Hammoth-dor","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":2},{"base":"H5873","lemma":"עֵין גַּנִּים","tr":"en gan·nim","gloss":"En-gannim","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":6},{"base":"H4733","lemma":"מִקְלָט","tr":"miq·lat","gloss":"refuge","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":20},{"base":"H7523","lemma":"רָצַח","tr":"ra·tsach","gloss":"to murder","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":47},{"base":"H4940","lemma":"מִשְׁפָּחָה","tr":"mish·pa·chah","gloss":"family","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":303},{"base":"H0702","lemma":"אַרְבַּע","tr":"ar·ba","gloss":"four","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":318},{"base":"H2520","lemma":"חֶלְקָת֙","tr":"chel·qat","gloss":"Helkath","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":2}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"NUM","chapter":13,"verse":21,"verseEnd":21,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"So they went up and spied out the land from the Wilderness of Zin as far as Rehob, toward Lebo-hamath.","from":31},{"book":"DEU","chapter":1,"verse":4,"verseEnd":4,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"This was after he had defeated Sihon king of the Amorites, who lived in Heshbon, and then at Edrei had defeated Og king of Bashan, who lived in Ashtaroth.","from":27},{"book":"DEU","chapter":4,"verse":43,"verseEnd":43,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Bezer in the wilderness on the plateau belonging to the Reubenites, Ramoth in Gilead belonging to the Gadites, or Golan in Bashan belonging to the Manassites.","from":27},{"book":"JOS","chapter":10,"verse":3,"verseEnd":3,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Therefore Adoni-zedek king of Jerusalem sent word to Hoham king of Hebron, Piram king of Jarmuth, Japhia king of Lachish, and Debir king of Eglon, saying,","from":29},{"book":"JOS","chapter":10,"verse":19,"verseEnd":19,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"But you, do not stop there. Pursue your enemies and attack them from behind. Do not let them reach their cities, for the LORD your God has delivered them into your hand.”","from":29},{"book":"JOS","chapter":10,"verse":21,"verseEnd":21,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"The whole army returned safely to Joshua in the camp at Makkedah, and no one dared to utter a word against the Israelites.","from":29},{"book":"JOS","chapter":10,"verse":23,"verseEnd":23,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"So they brought the five kings out of the cave—the kings of Jerusalem, Hebron, Jarmuth, Lachish, and Eglon.","from":29},{"book":"JOS","chapter":12,"verse":11,"verseEnd":11,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"the king of Jarmuth, one; the king of Lachish, one;","from":29}],"notes":[],"groups":[{"id":"patriarchs","title":"The patriarchal families","people":4}]},"34-42":{"people":[{"id":"levi-h3878","name":"Levi","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":3,"firstVerse":34},{"id":"merari-h4847","name":"Merari","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Levi","count":2,"firstVerse":34},{"id":"zebulun-h2074","name":"Zebulun","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":1,"firstVerse":34},{"id":"reuben-h7205","name":"Reuben","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":1,"firstVerse":36},{"id":"gad-h1410g","name":"Gad","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":1,"firstVerse":38},{"id":"israel-h3478","name":"Israel","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Isaac","count":1,"firstVerse":41}],"places":[{"id":"jokneam-h3362","name":"Jokneam","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":34},{"id":"kitron-h7003","name":"Kitron","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":34},{"id":"dimnah-h1829","name":"Dimnah","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":35},{"id":"nahalol-h5096","name":"Nahalol","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":35},{"id":"bezer-h1221g","name":"Bezer","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":36},{"id":"jahaz-h3096","name":"Jahaz","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":36},{"id":"kedemoth-h6932","name":"Kedemoth","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":37},{"id":"mephaath-h4158","name":"Mephaath","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":37},{"id":"gilead-h1568g","name":"Gilead","kind":"place","brief":"In Manasseh","count":1,"firstVerse":38},{"id":"mahanaim-h4266","name":"Mahanaim","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":38},{"id":"ramoth-h7216h","name":"Ramoth","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":38},{"id":"heshbon-h2809","name":"Heshbon","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":39},{"id":"jazer-h3270g","name":"Jazer","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":39}],"words":[{"base":"H4054","lemma":"מִגְרָשׁ","tr":"mig·rash","gloss":"pasture","lang":"h","inPassage":14,"uses":115},{"base":"H5892","lemma":"עִיר","tr":"ir","gloss":"excitement","lang":"h","inPassage":12,"uses":1090},{"base":"H4294","lemma":"מַטֶּה","tr":"mat·teh","gloss":"tribe: rod","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":252},{"base":"H3881","lemma":"לֵוִי","tr":"le·viy·yi","gloss":"Levi","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":291},{"base":"H4940","lemma":"מִשְׁפָּחָה","tr":"mish·pa·chah","gloss":"family","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":303},{"base":"H0702","lemma":"אַרְבַּע","tr":"ar·ba","gloss":"four","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":318},{"base":"H4847","lemma":"מְרָרִי","tr":"me·ra·ri","gloss":"Merari","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":36},{"base":"H3498","lemma":"יָתַר","tr":"ya·tar","gloss":"to remain","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":106},{"base":"H3362","lemma":"יׇקְנְעָם","tr":"yoq·ne·am","gloss":"Jokneam","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":3},{"base":"H5096","lemma":"נַהֲלֹל","tr":"na·ha·lal","gloss":"Nahalol","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":3}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"JOS","chapter":20,"verse":8,"verseEnd":8,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"And beyond the Jordan, east of Jericho, they designated Bezer on the wilderness plateau from the tribe of Reuben, Ramoth in Gilead from the tribe of Gad, and Golan in Bashan from the tribe of Manasseh.","from":36},{"book":"1CH","chapter":6,"verse":77,"verseEnd":77,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"The Merarites (the rest of the Levites) received the following: From the tribe of Zebulun they were given Rimmono and Tabor, together with their pasturelands.","from":34},{"book":"GEN","chapter":32,"verse":2,"verseEnd":2,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"When Jacob saw them, he said, “This is the camp of God.” So he named that place Mahanaim.","from":38},{"book":"GEN","chapter":49,"verse":7,"verseEnd":7,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Cursed be their anger, for it is strong, and their wrath, for it is cruel! I will disperse them in Jacob and scatter them in Israel.","from":41},{"book":"NUM","chapter":21,"verse":23,"verseEnd":23,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"But Sihon would not let Israel pass through his territory. Instead, he gathered his whole army and went out to confront Israel in the wilderness. When he came to Jahaz, he fought against Israel.","from":36},{"book":"NUM","chapter":21,"verse":26,"verseEnd":30,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Heshbon was the city of Sihon king of the Amorites, who had fought against the former king of Moab and taken all his land as far as the Arnon. That is why the poets say: “Come to Heshbon, let it be rebuilt; let the city of Sihon be restored. For a fire went out from Heshbon, a blaze from the city of Sihon. It consumed Ar of Moab, the rulers of Arnonʼs heights. Woe to you, O Moab! You are destroyed, O people of Chemosh! He gave up his sons as refugees, and his daughters into captivity to Sihon king of the Amorites. But we have overthrown them; Heshbon is destroyed as far as Dibon. We demolished them as far as Nophah, which reaches to Medeba.”","from":39},{"book":"NUM","chapter":26,"verse":62,"verseEnd":62,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"The registration of the Levites totaled 23,000, every male a month old or more; they were not numbered among the other Israelites, because no inheritance was given to them among the Israelites.","from":41},{"book":"NUM","chapter":32,"verse":1,"verseEnd":1,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Now the Reubenites and Gadites, who had very large herds and flocks, surveyed the lands of Jazer and Gilead, and they saw that the region was suitable for livestock.","from":39}],"notes":[],"groups":[{"id":"patriarchs","title":"The patriarchal families","people":5}]},"43-45":{"people":[{"id":"israel-h3478","name":"Israel","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Isaac","count":2,"firstVerse":43}],"places":[],"words":[{"base":"H7650","lemma":"שָׁבַע","tr":"sha·va","gloss":"to swear","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":186},{"base":"H0341","lemma":"אֹיֵב","tr":"o·yev","gloss":"enemy","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":282},{"base":"H5117","lemma":"נוּחַ","tr":"nu·ach","gloss":"to rest","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":142},{"base":"H3423","lemma":"יָרַשׁ","tr":"ya·rash","gloss":"to possess: possess","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":231},{"base":"H5439","lemma":"סָבִיב","tr":"sa·viv","gloss":"around","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":335},{"base":"H5307","lemma":"נָפַל","tr":"na·phal","gloss":"to fall: fall","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":434},{"base":"H9034","lemma":"הָ","tr":"ha","gloss":"her","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":490},{"base":"H5975","lemma":"עָמַד","tr":"a·mad","gloss":"to stand: stand","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":521},{"base":"H2896","lemma":"טוֹב","tr":"tov","gloss":"pleasant","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":538},{"base":"H3427","lemma":"יָשַׁב","tr":"ya·shav","gloss":"to dwell","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":1079}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"1KI","chapter":8,"verse":56,"verseEnd":56,"votes":30,"source":"both","text":"“Blessed be the LORD, who has given rest to His people Israel according to all that He promised. Not one word has failed of all the good promises He made through His servant Moses.","from":45},{"book":"NUM","chapter":23,"verse":19,"verseEnd":19,"votes":20,"source":"both","text":"God is not a man, that He should lie, or a son of man, that He should change His mind. Does He speak and not act? Does He promise and not fulfill?","from":45},{"book":"JOS","chapter":23,"verse":14,"verseEnd":14,"votes":20,"source":"openbible","text":"Now behold, today I am going the way of all the earth, and you know with all your heart and soul that not one of the good promises the LORD your God made to you has failed. Everything was fulfilled for you; not one promise has failed.","from":45},{"book":"JOS","chapter":23,"verse":15,"verseEnd":15,"votes":20,"source":"openbible","text":"But just as every good thing the LORD your God promised you has come to pass, likewise the LORD will bring upon you the calamity He has threatened, until He has destroyed you from this good land He has given you.","from":45},{"book":"1TH","chapter":5,"verse":24,"verseEnd":24,"votes":16,"source":"both","text":"The One who calls you is faithful, and He will do it.","from":45},{"book":"1CO","chapter":1,"verse":9,"verseEnd":9,"votes":14,"source":"both","text":"God, who has called you into fellowship with His Son Jesus Christ our Lord, is faithful.","from":45},{"book":"TIT","chapter":1,"verse":2,"verseEnd":2,"votes":12,"source":"both","text":"in the hope of eternal life, which God, who cannot lie, promised before time began.","from":45},{"book":"HEB","chapter":6,"verse":18,"verseEnd":18,"votes":12,"source":"both","text":"Thus by two unchangeable things in which it is impossible for God to lie, we who have fled to take hold of the hope set before us may be strongly encouraged.","from":45}],"notes":[{"id":"land-promise-fulfilled","title":"The land promised and the land possessed","kind":"prophecy"}],"groups":[]}}